# The commit of rust-js-lang/react-in-rust that rust-js's port checks build
# (scripts/react-in-rust.ts): the nightly's `port` compiles its crates and
# compares their JS with what it committed, and each push that changes the
# bindings `cargo check`s it (react-in-rust.yml). A change to its JS that's
# intended is accepted by moving this to the port's commit that has it.
